{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39977","headline":"献内翰杨侍郎 · 徐夤","name":"献内翰杨侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"窗开青琐见瑶台，冷拂星辰逼上台。\n丹凤诏成中使取，白龙香近圣君来。\n欲言温署三缄口，闲赋宫词八斗才。\n莫拟吟云避荣贵，庙堂玉铉待盐梅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39977.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39977","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}